message: "If you use this software or the benchmark, please cite the paper below."
title: "When Models Edit Too Much: On the Fidelity of Minimal Code Edits"
abstract: >-
  Code and evaluation framework for measuring over-editing in LLM code repair:
  400 BigCodeBench tasks with injected AST-level corruptions, giving each repair
  task a known minimal patch, plus prompting and post-training experiments.
